- PLACEHOLDER_TEXT && strong===0 && medium===0 && weak>0 → S1 (placeholder claim + only weak evidence) — matches C2 design
- PLACEHOLDER_TEXT && strong===0 && medium>0 → S2 (placeholder claim, evidence only in-network)

Simplest: move the placeholder check BEFORE the only-weak check, but require: placeholder && strong===0 && medium===0 → S1; placeholder && strong===0 && medium>0 → S2.

