## search_plugins
Read-only discovery for recommend-connectors and recommend-experts. Search installable candidates that match the user's request — their pipeline, accounts, contracts, tickets, playbooks, or company data — when no existing tool covers it. Covers two categories via `type`: connector and expert. Returns real, currently valid candidates; never installs, connects, or enables anything, and is the only source for candidates (do not use web search). When relevant candidates are returned, use a single suggest_plugin_install call to present up to three candidates in one card instead of listing them in text.

